    {
      "_key": "k000vw",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000vx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Hospitals, stores, restaurants and plants don't close on Saturday, and neither do we. Uriah Child Care is open "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000vy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Saturday, 6 am to 11 pm"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000vz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", the same hours as Monday to Friday. We are closed on Sunday."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000w0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000w1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The same routine as the rest of the week"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000w2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000w3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Saturdays follow the same routine as weekdays: meals and snacks, play-based learning, rest time and play. Children see familiar faces, which helps when your schedule changes from week to week."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000w4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000w5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A Saturday at Uriah"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000w6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000w7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Meals are served at the same times on Saturday as during the week: breakfast from 7:30 to 9 am, lunch at 12 noon, a snack at 3 pm, dinner at 6 pm and an evening snack at 9 pm. Toddlers and younger children have circle time, play-based activities and rest time. School-age kids can get homework help with weekend assignments, on every shift."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000w8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000w9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Who Saturday care is for"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000wa",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Nurses working Saturday shifts, retail and restaurant staff, warehouse and plant workers, and any parent who has to work a Saturday. Children can stay until 11 pm on Saturday too. Need care after 11 pm? Call us and Ms. Paulette will talk with you about it."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000wc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000wd",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Saturdays only, or the whole week"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
